    "measure": "Elapsed time",
    "unit": "ms",
    "statistic": "median",
    "method": "One untimed warm-up, then five timed runs per case. The clock (hrtime in PHP, perf_counter_ns in Python) covers the case's call only; loading the inputs of the group and join cases, runtime startup, and conversion of Polars results to PHP arrays are excluded. The data files are written immediately before the runs and are in the page cache.",
    "time_spent_in": "the measured process: the PHP process for phpolars and plain PHP, the Python process for py-polars",
